    "brief": "LOAD\r\nOnce a Field has been saved with the SaveField component,\r\nit can be quickly reloaded in Grasshopper using the LoadField\r\ncomponent. This allows to split Field generation and aggregation\r\nin two separate files, avoiding costly computing.\r\nThe LOAD input can be triggered with a button to reload the file\r\nafter changes.",
